	And I add an order with the product "Portal Production" and support level "Gold" to the project code "ZENOSBA"
	Then the organization "Zen OSB Automotive" should be present on zendesk.liferay.com
	When I edit a project with the name "Zen OSB Automotive" and code "ZENOSBA" to have a support lifetime of "1 Minute" starting "60" days ago for the product "Portal Production"
	And I automatically have all expired projects moved to on hold status
	Then the organization "Zen OSB Automotive" should not have the tag "liferay_portal"
	And the organization "Zen OSB Automotive" should have the tag "regular"
	And the organization "Zen OSB Automotive" should have the tag "us"
	And the organization "Zen OSB Automotive" should not have the tag "gold"
	And the organization "Zen OSB Automotive" should have the tag "english"
	And the organization "Zen OSB Automotive" should have the tag "closed"
	And the organization "Zen OSB Automotive" should not have the tag "approved"
	And the organization "Zen OSB Automotive" should have the following parameters
	| Name                       | Zen OSB Automotive |
	| Details                    | 123 Main Street    |
	| Details                    | United States      |
	| Details                    | 123 Main Street    |
	| Details                    | California         |
	| SLA                        | Gold               |
	| Status                     | Closed             |
	| Support Region             | US                 |
	| Support Language           | English            |
	| Tier                       | Regular            |
	| Account Code               | ZENOSBA            |
	| Partner First Line Support | false              |

